@startuml
title Error Handling Associations
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

class "Error Handling Unit" as EHU <<Component>> {
  + perform handling operation
  + produce THandlingOperationResult
}
class "ErrorHandlingOperationEntry[THandlingOperationResult]" as EOE <<Class>> {
  errorHandlingUnitIdentity
  handlingOperationAttemptIdentity
  handlingOperationIdentity
  targetOccurrenceReferences
  operationResult
  stepInstanceIdentity
  association identities
  invocation identity
}
class "ErrorHandlerResult[THandlingOperationEntry,TErrorHandlingContext]" as EHR <<Class>> {
  handlingOperations: Collection[THandlingOperationEntry]
  errorHandlingContext: TErrorHandlingContext
}
class "OperationEntryPublisher" as Pub <<Contract>> {
  + reserve(attemptIdentity)
  + publish(reservation, entry)
  + get_publication_status
  + release(reservation)
}
class "PublicationReservation" as Res <<Class>> {
  state: Reserved/Consumed/Released
  publisherIdentity
  invocationIdentity
  errorHandlingUnitIdentity
  handlingOperationAttemptIdentity
  association identities
}
class "SPUError occurrence" as SE <<Entity>> {
  producerSPUIdentity
  occurrenceIdentity
}
class "Recovery Owner" as RO <<Component>> {
  + ambiguous-acceptance escrow
  + status reconciliation
}
class "Step-specific Error Handling Composition" as Comp <<Component>> {
  + assembles ErrorHandlerResult
}

EHU --> EOE : produces operation entry
EOE --> EHR : forms aggregate
Pub ..> Res : issues & validates & consumes
EHU --> Pub : requests reservation / publishes
Res --> EOE : authorizes acceptance of at most one entry
EHR --> SE : related through occurrence references only
EHR ..> RO : unresolved custody transfer
Comp .> EHR : assembles & integrates into StepExecutionResult

note right of Pub : Atomic acceptance: Reserved <-> Consumed / Released
No partial acceptance
Reservation cardinality: one per Handling Operation Attempt

@enduml